OL,3,GNEWSAMan cleared of raping woman in
OL,4,Abarbershop
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man accused of raping a woman in a
OL,7,Fbarbershop has been acquitted.
OL,9,FJurors took just over an hour to find
OL,10,FJowad Haji not guilty of the charges of
OL,11,Frape, attempted rape, sexual assault,
OL,12,Fassault by penetration and intentional
OL,13,Fstrangulation.
OL,15,FThe 24-year-old, of Coventry, was
OL,16,Faccused of raping the woman, who cannot
OL,17,Fbe named for legal reasons, in the
OL,18,FStratford-upon-Avon shop after offering
OL,19,Fher a job there in January, a trial at
OL,20,FWarwick Crown Court heard.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
